    "title": "Kaya's Winter Weekend",
    "sentences": [
      "It was a cold January weekend.",
      "Kaya would get to the mall for new jeans, a shoe, and two socks.",
      "She walked along the street, straight to the shop.",
      "She saw a picture of a tropical island inside.",
      "Kaya had a problem finding her size, so she would order a chocolate drink.",
      "She wanted to pay cash.",
      "Later, she would turn on her computer.",
      "She would write a fantasy story about a witch's battle.",
      "She cannot use the pool for a swim today.",
      "Instead, she made a salad with olive oil and bread.",
      "Her recipe was from her favorite band's website.",
      "\"Are you sure?\" her mom asked. \"Be careful.\""
    ]
  }
